name: ['Bog Humbugs', 'Chaos Wrap', 'Decorated Knight // Present Arms', 'Evil Presents', 'Fruitcake Elemental', 'Gifts Given', 'Goblin Sleigh Ride', 'Last-Minute Chopping', "Mishra's Toy Workshop", 'Naughty // Nice', "Season's Beatings", 'Seasonal Sequels', 'Snow Mercy', 'Some Disassembly Required', 'Stocking Tiger', 'Thopter Pie Network', 'Topdeck the Halls', 'Yule Ooze']
